---
title: Definition 21
---
order: 21
---
short_label: I.Def.21
---
statement: Further, of trilateral figures, a <i>right-angled triangle</i> is that which has a right angle, an <i>obtuse-angled triangle</i> that which has an obtuse angle, and an <i>acute-angled triangle</i> that which has its three angles acute.
